// Merged over tauri.conf.json by `make desktop PROFIL=release MISE_A_JOUR=1`,
// which the release workflow alone runs.
//
// Updater artifacts are signed with the minisign private key, which exists
// only in the release secrets: enabling them in tauri.conf.json would make
// every local release build fail for want of a key. The endpoint is not
// configured here either: the Rust code carries it (ADR-0051).
{
  bundle: {
    createUpdaterArtifacts: true,
  },
}
